static const char DATA_001919[425] = "Commander [Pn.  We will release your hyperdrive on the condition that you return  directly to the Thargoid home world and deliver our new gift.  They trust you now.  If you  target them on the central world on arrival in their system, the missiles will home on the  required sites.  You will then be able to hyperspace to safety.  Do not attempt to defy us.  IF you succeed, you will return to our worlds a Hero.  Leave now.";  // ffedat.asm:1190-1191
